OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be cold with a frosty
OL,6,Fstart for many. Mostly dry with sunny
OL,7,Fspells through the day, but cloudier
OL,8,Fwith a few showers towards
OL,9,FBerwickshire and East Lothain.
OL,10,FSunshine turning hazier with higher
OL,11,Fcloud feeding from south for afternoon.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FDry through the evening but
OL,14,Fwith strengthening southeast winds.
OL,15,FRain and hill snow will spread north
OL,16,Fovernight and becoming windy,
OL,17,Fparticularly in the southwest.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
